<metadata><name>Ida Lewis Distance Race 2026</name><desc>2026 Ida Lewis Distance Race (Aug 14-15, 2026). Source: Addendum 1 - Courses (Course Booklet: Mark Register, "A" and "R" course descriptions, course plots) with SI Amendment No. 1 applied (Yellow Tetrahedron 071 19.61 W), and SI Rev 7 (incorporates Amendments 1 and 2). All mark positions are the printed approximate lat/long from the booklet. Start (SI 8.4): line between the RC signal boat anchored S of Rose Island and a nearby race mark; drawn at the Mark Register rendezvous position. Finish (SI 10.1): line between G3 Bell S of Goat Island and an orange flag staff at the N end of the Ida Lewis YC deck; routes end at G3. SI 10.2: yellow inflatable at approx 41 28.81 N 071 19.61 W is a mark of the course, left to starboard, not part of the finishing line. ORC 1 only (Amendment 2): finishing line is ILYC flag staff to the western tower of the Pell Bridge (approx 41 30.3407 N 071 21.0930 W) and the yellow mark does not apply - not drawn. Cox Ledge wind farm is an Obstruction (SI 1.8, 19.3, Appendix A): do not enter. Points named (routing) are not marks: they only keep the drawn line off land and follow the booklet plots (S of Block Island, off Montauk Pt, The Race, Plum Gut). Sides are as printed in the Leave To column. NOT FOR NAVIGATION.</desc></metadata>
